@startuml
title 智颐养老系统 - 分页查询流程(BaseController+PageHelper)

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E4D7B
  ActorBorderColor #2E4D7B
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E4D7B
}

participant "Controller\n(extends BaseController)" as ctrl
participant "BaseController" as base
participant "PageHelper" as pageHelper
participant "Service" as svc
participant "Mapper" as mapper
participant "MySQL" as db

== 1. 开始分页查询 ==
ctrl -> base : startPage()
base -> base : TableSupport.buildPageRequest()
note right
  从HttpServletRequest
  读取参数:
  pageNum  页码(默认1)
  pageSize 每页条数(默认10)
  orderByColumn 排序列
  isAsc    升/降序
  reasonable 是否合理化
end note

base -> pageHelper : PageHelper.startPage()
pageHelper -> pageHelper : PageThreadLocal.set(page)

== 2. 设置排序 ==
ctrl -> base : startOrderBy()
base -> base : SqlUtil.escapeOrderBySql()
note right
  防SQL注入:
  仅允许字母/数字/
  下划线/空格
end note
base -> pageHelper : PageHelper.orderBy(sql)

== 3. 执行查询 ==
ctrl -> svc : selectList(query)
svc -> mapper : selectList(query)

mapper -> db : SELECT ... LIMIT ?, ?
note right
  PageHelper自动拦截
  第一个MyBatis查询
  改写SQL添加
  LIMIT + COUNT
  两条语句执行
end note

db --> mapper : 分页数据 + 总条数
mapper --> svc : List<Entity>
svc --> ctrl : List<Entity>

== 4. 封装结果 ==
ctrl -> base : getDataTable(list)
base -> base : new PageInfo(list)
note right
  从PageInfo获取:
  total 总记录数
  pageNum 当前页码
  封装到TableDataInfo
  {code, rows, total, msg}
end note

base --> ctrl : TableDataInfo
ctrl --> client : 返回JSON

== 5. 清理 ==
base -> pageHelper : clearPage()

@enduml
